{"id":"certeza","lemma":"certeza","pos":"noun","rank":3050,"glosses":["certainty"],"ipa":"/θeɾˈteθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"certezas"},"order":3055,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/41/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-certeza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es todo la que sabemos con certeza.","en":"That's all we know for sure.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Tenía la certeza de que vendrías.","en":"I was certain that you'd come.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/600204","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"to come","l":"venir"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"that"]]},{"text":"No conozco con certeza dónde nací.","en":"I don't know exactly where I was born.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/451584","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"with"},null,{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be born","l":"nacer"}]}]}